# Outline badges only

All `Badge` usage must be `variant="outline"`. Never use filled badge variants.

- Unread counts and **New** labels use outline + `notificationBadgeClassName` (blue tint) from `@/components/ui/badge`
- Numeric counts use `countBadgeClassName` (optionally with `notificationBadgeClassName`) — do not re-declare size utilities
- Status colors are outline + semantic className tints (blue / amber / green / destructive), not badge variants
- Weight is `font-normal` on the Badge primitive — do not add `font-medium`

See `design.md` → Badges.
